@title EMC fix-it: preview shortening shield pigtails
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The shields fixture has a cable whose shield ends in a pigtail. If the pigtail is longer than the limit the finding offers "Preview: Shorten the pigtail", which names the shield ends it would set. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-shields.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "EMC check"
shot 01-findings
check_layout
scroll 360 400 -450
wait 10
expect "Preview: Shorten the pigtail"
shot 02-pigtail-fixes
click_text "Preview: Shorten the pigtail" #1
wait 10
expect "Clears EMC-05"
expect "set to a pigtail of"
shot 03-pigtail-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)"
wait 15
expect_not "Clears EMC-05"
shot 04-pigtail-applied
check_layout
